e to the collection and processing of the personal data needed to process, confirm and fulfil your order."}],"$L33","$L34"]]}],"$L35","$L36","$L37","$L38","$L39"],false]}]]}]
33:["$","p","Personal data is processed only for legitimate purposes: delivering tickets and products, and — with your consent — newsletters, promotions and analytics (see the Cookie Policy). It is stored only for as long as these purposes require, in accordance with Law No. 195/2024 on Personal Data Protection.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"Personal data is processed only for legitimate purposes: delivering tickets and products, and — with your consent — newsletters, promotions and analytics (see the Cookie Policy). It is stored only for as long as these purposes require, in accordance with Law No. 195/2024 on Personal Data Protection."}]
34:["$","p","We use commercial security measures to prevent unauthorised access and to keep the data accurate. Data sent over the internet or a wireless network can never be fully protected, so we cannot guarantee the security of the information you send us.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"We use commercial security measures to prevent unauthorised access and to keep the data accurate. Data sent over the internet or a wireless network can never be fully protected, so we cannot guarantee the security of the information you send us."}]
35:["$","section","Ordering and payment",{"className":"legal-section","id":"3-ordering-and-payment","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"legal-section__title","children":[3,". ","Ordering and payment"]}],[["$","p","To order, choose your tickets or products, enter your contact details, accept these Terms and pay online. Orders are paid by bank card (Visa, Mastercard, American Express), Apple Pay or Google Pay. Prices are shown in euro (EUR) and include all taxes.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"To order, choose your tickets or products, enter your contact details, accept these Terms and pay online. Orders are paid by bank card (Visa, Mastercard, American Express), Apple Pay or Google Pay. Prices are shown in euro (EUR) and include all taxes."}],["$","p","Payments are processed by maib (BC “MAIB” S.A.) using 3-D Secure: at checkout you are redirected to a secure maib payment page, where your bank may ask you to confirm the payment with a one-time code. The payment page asks for the card number, the expiry date, the CVV/CVC code and the cardholder’s name. Card data is encrypted and stored only on the payment processor’s secure server; it is never entered on or stored by this website.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"Payments are processed by maib (BC “MAIB” S.A.) using 3-D Secure: at checkout you are redirected to a secure maib payment page, where your bank may ask you to confirm the payment with a one-time code. The payment page asks for the card number, the expiry date, the CVV/CVC code and the cardholder’s name. Card data is encrypted and stored only on the payment processor’s secure server; it is never entered on or stored by this website."}],["$","p","If your card currency differs from the transaction currency, the conversion is made under the conditions of the bank that issued your card.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"If your card currency differs from the transaction currency, the conversion is made under the conditions of the bank that issued your card."}],["$","p","After a successful payment you receive a confirmation by e-mail with the order number, the amount, the currency, the payment date and the list of ordered items. [How the fiscal receipt is issued.]",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"After a successful payment you receive a confirmation by e-mail with the order number, the amount, the currency, the payment date and the list of ordered items. [How the fiscal receipt is issued.]"}],["$","p","Refunds are made only to the card used for the purchase.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"Refunds are made only to the card used for the purchase."}]]]}]
36:["$","section","Delivery",{"className":"legal-section","id":"4-delivery","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"legal-section__title","children":[4,". ","Delivery"]}],[["$","p","E-tickets are sent to the e-mail address given in the order right after a successful payment and are shown on the order confirmation page. Show the QR code from the e-ticket at the entrance.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"E-tickets are sent to the e-mail address given in the order right after a successful payment and are shown on the order confirmation page. Show the QR code from the e-ticket at the entrance."}],["$","p","Merchandise is delivered in the Republic of Moldova within [X] working days of the order confirmation, between [time] and [time]. Delivery costs [PRICE] and is free for orders from [PRICE]; the delivery cost is included in the order total. [Pickup at the festival.]",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"Merchandise is delivered in the Republic of Moldova within [X] working days of the order confirmation, between [time] and [time]. Delivery costs [PRICE] and is free for orders from [PRICE]; the delivery cost is included in the order total. [Pickup at the festival.]"}],["$","p","Delivery may take longer in exceptional cases (bad weather, public holidays, unforeseen technical problems); we will let you know in advance. One delivery address is accepted per order.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"Delivery may take longer in exceptional cases (bad weather, public holidays, unforeseen technical problems); we will let you know in advance. One delivery address is accepted per order."}],["$","p","When receiving the parcel, please check the packaging and the receipt in the presence of the courier. Later claims about these are not accepted.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"When receiving the parcel, please check the packaging and the receipt in the presence of the courier. Later claims about these are not accepted."}]]]}]
37:["$","section","Returns and refunds",{"className":"legal-section","id":"5-returns-and-refunds","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"legal-section__title","children":[5,". ","Returns and refunds"]}],[["$","p","Under Law No. 105/2003 on Consumer Protection, merchandise can be returned within 14 days of payment. The money is refunded to the card used for the purchase.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"Under Law No. 105/2003 on Consumer Protection, merchandise can be returned within 14 days of payment. The money is refunded to the card used for the purchase."}],["$","p","[Items that cannot be exchanged or returned under Annex 2 of Government Decision No. 1465 of 08.12.2003.]",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"[Items that cannot be exchanged or returned under Annex 2 of Government Decision No. 1465 of 08.12.2003.]"}],["$","p","Tickets: [refund and exchange rules for tickets, including what happens if the event is cancelled or postponed].",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"Tickets: [refund and exchange rules for tickets, including what happens if the event is cancelled or postponed]."}],["$","p","Returns contact: +373 67 256 551. Return requests are processed within [X] days. Return conditions: [conditions].",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"Returns contact: +373 67 256 551. Return requests are processed within [X] days. Return conditions: [conditions]."}]]]}]
38:["$","section","Privacy policy",{"className":"legal-section","id":"6-privacy-policy","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"legal-section__title","children":[6,". ","Privacy policy"]}],[["$","p","In accordance with Law No. 195/2024 on Personal Data Protection, the Seller processes personal data in good faith, lawfully, by automated and manual means, under conditions that ensure security and confidentiality.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"In accordance with Law No. 195/2024 on Personal Data Protection, the Seller processes personal data in good faith, lawfully, by automated and manual means, under conditions that ensure security and confidentiality."}],["$","p","We collect only the data you give us when ordering: first and last name, phone number, e-mail and, for merchandise, the delivery address. It is used to run the website, deliver orders and contact you about your order.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"We collect only the data you give us when ordering: first and last name, phone number, e-mail and, for merchandise, the delivery address. It is used to run the website, deliver orders and contact you about your order."}],["$","p","We do not disclose, sell or exchange your data with third parties without your consent, except where the law requires it (requests from public authorities, law enforcement or courts). We do not collect payment card data: card number, expiry date and similar details are handled by the payment processor.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"We do not disclose, sell or exchange your data with third parties without your consent, except where the law requires it (requests from public authorities, law enforcement or courts). We do not collect payment card data: card number, expiry date and similar details are handled by the payment processor."}],["$","p","For questions about your data, write to usernameincode@gmail.com or call +373 67 256 551. See also the Privacy Policy and the Personal Data Processing Agreement.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"For questions about your data, write to usernameincode@gmail.com or call +373 67 256 551. See also the Privacy Policy and the Personal Data Processing Agreement."}]]]}]
